[al:新概念英语（一）]
[ar:MP3 同步字幕版（美音）]
[ti:A Trip to Australia]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.73]Lesson 123 | 第123课
[00:04.00]A trip to Australia | 澳大利亚之行
[00:07.35]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:12.94]Who is the man with the beard? | 那个留胡子的人是谁?
[00:17.83]Look, Scott. | 斯科特,你看。
[00:19.99]This is a photograph I took during my trip to Australia. | 这是我在澳大利亚旅行时拍的一张照片。
[00:26.64]Let me see it, Mike. | 迈克,让我看看。
[00:29.24]This is a good photograph. | 这是一张很好的照片。
[00:31.95]Who are these people? | 这些人是谁?
[00:35.04]They're people I met during the trip. | 他们是我在旅途中遇到的人。
[00:39.49]That's the ship we travelled on. | 那就是我们乘坐的船。
[00:42.39]What a beautiful ship! | 多么漂亮的船啊!
[00:45.01]Who's this? | 这是谁?
[00:47.12]That's the man I told you about. | 那就是我跟你说过的那个男人。
[00:50.19]Remember? | 你还记得吗?
[00:51.58]Ah yes. | 啊,是的。
[00:53.10]The one who offered you a job in Australia. | 就是那个要在澳大利亚给你一份工作的男人。
[00:57.44]That's right. | 对。
[00:58.90]Who's this? | 这是谁?
[01:00.64]Guess! | 你猜!
[01:01.74]It's not you, is it? | 不是你,是吗?
[01:04.17]That's right. | 对。
[01:06.73]I grew a beard during the trip, but I shaved it off when I came home. | 我在旅途中留了胡子,但我回到家就把胡子刮了。
[01:13.50]Why did you shave it off? | 你为什么把胡子刮了?
[01:16.16]My wife didn't like it! | 我妻子不喜欢!